<title>ISRAEL: Israel's AIPM Q3 net 8.62 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel's AIPM Q3 net 8.62 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Israeli Paper Mills reported the following third-quarter results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			  (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			    Q3 96	Q3 95     9-MTH 96     9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  284,188    277,216     817,168     846,525</p>
<p>Operating profit	15,491     23,687	39,075	76,845</p>
<p>Net Profit		 8,623     16,035	71,444	52,447</p>
<p>($1 = 3.24)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
